// Override for the full existing Higgs-portal particle.tbl, not a replacement.
// The pilot changes only the PDG 36 record and preserves all other definitions.
// DD4hep Geant4ExtraParticles interprets the last column as c*tau in mm.
// A width of -1 marks PDG 36 unstable BEFORE DD4hep computes its width
// from the positive lifetime. Width 0 would incorrectly mark it stable.
// ID name charge_in_thirds mass_GeV width_flag ctau_mm
36 H_3^0 0 55.0 -1.0 100.0
